        "suggestion": {
          "decision": "approve",
          "message": "The preparation accumulator belongs to the shared work, while ownership is added separately for each caller, so reuse does not inherit ownership ([b1.r104], [b1.r105]). The base-ready event remains unconditional, with preparation attributes only for its initiating search; store attributes remain on each search ([b1.r79]). The change respects graph-client's normalized observation boundary and background preparation options ([b1.r95], [b1.r96]). Approved on code reading; proof is not recorded."
        }
