        "after": "The file declares its fixed-service-receipt purpose and imports the helpers needed to run searches and inspect trace records. No execution proof is recorded. Loading the file synchronously creates a unique temporary workspace and retains its path for the test and final cleanup. No run is recorded. Bun invokes the shared fake-engine root cleanup after each test. No test run is recorded to demonstrate cleanup execution. Bun runs a final hook that synchronously removes the temporary workspace recursively, tolerating its absence. No recorded run demonstrates the final filesystem state. Git setup…",
